 href={MAPS_SHARE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b class="text-[#072e33]">Google Maps listing — {ATTRACTION_FULL_NAME}</b><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#60706e]">Address, Plus Code, rating and review-count snapshot.</p></a><a class="card p-5" href={GOVT_TOURISM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b class="text-[#072e33]">{GOVT_TOURISM_LABEL}</b><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#60706e]">Official updates and regional tourism information for {STATE_PROVINCE}, {COUNTRY_NAME}.</p></a></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm text-[#6a7775]">Photography: hero image source Hinterscapes; supporting Dona Paula images use Wikimedia Commons file redirects, with creator and licence information on their source pages. For production publishing, keep these attributions or replace with your own licensed local photographs.</p></div></section>
